            <ArticleTitle>Psychological factors in the failed back.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>29-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain is a complex phenomenon. Lack of understanding of its nature leads to two common mistakes in the failed back, firstly to look for a discrete physical cause and secondly to ascribe pain to psychological causes. This paper explores the nature of pain in the failed back and discusses the implications for treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
